{"tool_name":"nuclei-segmentation-(stardist)","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>This workflow applies a Stardist pre-trained model (versatile_fluo or versatile_HE) depending on the input images ie. uses both models for a dataset including both fluorescence (grayscale or RGB where all channels are equal) and H&amp;E stained (RGB where channels are not equal) images.</p>\n\n<p>This version uses tensorflow CPU version (See Dockerfile) to ensure compatibility with a larger number of computers. A GPU version should be possible by adapting the Dockerfile with tensorflow-gpu and/or nvidia-docker images.</p>","summary":"","value":"<p dir=\"auto\">This workflow applies a Stardist pre-trained model (versatile_fluo or versatile_HE) depending on the input images ie. uses both models for a dataset including both fluorescence (grayscale or RGB where all channels are equal) and H&amp;E stained (RGB where channels are not equal) images.</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"auto\">This version uses tensorflow CPU version (See Dockerfile) to ensure compatibility with a larger number of computers. A GPU version should be possible by adapting the Dockerfile with tensorflow-gpu and/or nvidia-docker images.</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2023-05-17T14:12:24+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2023-04-27T16:39:53+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[{"cid":null,"comment_count":null,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":null,"last_comment_uid":null,"status":2}],"free_tagging":[{"target_id":4372,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"564b5f0b-e429-40c8-acbc-2ee6bcb29616","url":"/taxonomy/term/4372"}],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1682613678,"last_comment_uid":19,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"BIAFLOWS team"}],"has_biological_terms":[{"target_